&lt;p&gt;ISLAMABAD: Bestway Group on Saturday launched Chinese automaker Geely Auto in Pakistan, acquiring the Proton plant at Port Qasim, Karachi, for assembly.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Bestway Automotive, Geely’s sole authorised distributor, will handle sales and after-sales service.&lt;/p&gt;

